\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {I}{\ignorespaces C3 control at $-10$~dB, $100$ paired strong-initializer trials. RMSEs are conditional on the inliers of each row, so $P_{\rm  cat}$ is reported beside them; ``Pos.'' denotes position RMSE, ``Eval.'' the median outer evaluation count, ``Unit inv.'' unit invariance, and ``Cert.'' a certified inner clock solve. Six decimal places are shown only to expose the unit dependence of the explicit 4-D route and are not a precision claim.}}{13}{}\protected@file@percent }
